## 询盘原文
Hello, we are importers of small kitchen appliances based in Lagos, Nigeria. We want 1,000 pcs of your portable blender cup BL-35P for our supermarket customers. Please confirm the goods will come with SONCAP certificate, because customs in Lagos will not clear the shipment without it. Kindly quote CIF Lagos (Apapa port). Payment: 30% deposit, 70% by L/C at sight. Thanks, Chinedu Okafor (sales@example-lagos.ng)

